  "description": "Evolve the holder, granting an effect based on their role.<br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Tank alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Tank: Gain @TankHP_TOOLTIPONLY@ health and grow in size.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Marksman alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Marksman: Gain @MarksmanBonusAS_TOOLTIPONLY*100@% Attack Speed. On cast, knock back their target if within @MarksmanKnockbackRange_TOOLTIPONLY@ hexes of them.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Fighter alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Fighter/Assassin: Gain @FighterAP_TOOLTIPONLY@ Ability Power & @FighterAD_TOOLTIPONLY@% Attack Damage. Triple it when below @FighterHealthThreshold_TOOLTIPONLY@% Health.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Caster alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Caster: For every @CasterManaSpent_TOOLTIPONLY@ Mana spent, throw a @CasterHexRadius_TOOLTIPONLY@-hex fireball that deals @CasterHPRatio_TOOLTIPONLY*100@% max Health true damage, 33% <TFTKeyword>Wounds</TFTKeyword>, and 1% <TFTKeyword>Burns</TFTKeyword> for @CasterDuration_TOOLTIPONLY@ seconds.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Specialist alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Specialist: Gain @SpecialistNumStars_TOOLTIPONLY@ stars that orbit this champion. Each star deals @SpecialistMissileDamage_TOOLTIPONLY@ magic damage and the orbit expands to hit the champion's current target.</TFTGuildActive>",
  "tooltip": "Evolve the holder, granting an effect based on their role.<br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Tank alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Tank: Gain @TankHP_TOOLTIPONLY@ health and grow in size.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Marksman alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Marksman: Gain @MarksmanBonusAS_TOOLTIPONLY*100@% Attack Speed. On cast, knock back their target if within @MarksmanKnockbackRange_TOOLTIPONLY@ hexes of them.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Fighter alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Fighter/Assassin: Gain @FighterAP_TOOLTIPONLY@ Ability Power & @FighterAD_TOOLTIPONLY@% Attack Damage. Triple it when below @FighterHealthThreshold_TOOLTIPONLY@% Health.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Caster alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Caster: For every @CasterManaSpent_TOOLTIPONLY@ Mana spent, throw a @CasterHexRadius_TOOLTIPONLY@-hex fireball that deals @CasterHPRatio_TOOLTIPONLY*100@% max Health true damage, 33% <TFTKeyword>Wounds</TFTKeyword>, and 1% <TFTKeyword>Burns</TFTKeyword> for @CasterDuration_TOOLTIPONLY@ seconds.</TFTGuildActive><br><br><TFTGuildActive enabled=TFT17_Anomaly_Specialist alternate=TFTGuildInactive>Specialist: Gain @SpecialistNumStars_TOOLTIPONLY@ stars that orbit this champion. Each star deals @SpecialistMissileDamage_TOOLTIPONLY@ magic damage and the orbit expands to hit the champion's current target.</TFTGuildActive>",
